300	    /**
301	     * The immutable structured event emitted on a successful owner create. {@code seq} is the
302	     * process-wide monotonically increasing sequence across creates; {@code ownerId} is the new
303	     * owner's id; {@code customerCode} carries the owner's current primary identifier (today the
304	     * customer code, whatever replaces it later); {@code membershipLevel} is the owner's membership
305	     * level. It serializes to a compact JSON object whose {@code event} is always
306	     * {@value #EVENT_TYPE}.
